                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "concept-type",
                  "description": "(Required) The type of the concept, used for Constructing a Semantic API Request by Concept Type and Specific Concept Name. The parameter is defined as a name-value pair, as in \"concept_type=[nytd_geo|nytd_per|nytd_org|nytd_des]\".\n"
                }
              ]
